WEBVTT

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:37.500
Do you know what Shikabane Hime are?

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:42.010
Shikabane Hime have a contract.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.030
If they defeat one hundred and eight Corpses,

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.920
they can go to heaven.

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:50.890
Heaven?

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.210
Yamagami-san?!

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:01.500
I won't forgive it!

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:10.640
Yamagami-san.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:11.480
Are you...

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:14.520
She is a Corpse killing Shikabane Hime.

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:25.790
Kougon cult’s Contracted Priest

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:28.570
Sougi Takamasa...

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:30.770
...has arrived!

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:39.700
Note: The first kanji of the rank Genpaku means Archer.
That new Genpaku was a student of Umehara, right?

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:44.850
The Sougi family that has inherited the title of Genpaku from generation to generation is much better at fighting...

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:48.640
Normally Umehara should belong to the Shuhou cult like Takamine.

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:52.600
But Umehara doesn’t have any connections in the Shujou cult and the Shuhou cult.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:55.950
That's why you have been sent here to investigate Keisei, right?

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.020
But I guess you don't need to do that.

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:01.390
Just leave it to the Genpaku.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:07.610
It is clear that Kagami Oori has been spotted many times with a Shikabane Hime.

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.460
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:11.460
About that betrayer priest.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:15.730
Shishidou Akasha has been witnessed around here.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:22.090
If that Kagami boy was involved, it would mean that that boy is moving with a purpose.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:28.370
It could also mean that the encounter of those two, when he was still in training wasn't a coincidence.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.370
That's some sloppy detective work.

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:31.780
There were three of them.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.400
The other one was me.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.400
We know that.

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:37.400
I see.

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:39.400
Akasha is my prey.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:44.850
If Oori and Keisei associate with him, I’ll have to dispose both of them.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:53.240
Even though there are more than a hundred Shikabane Hime out there, yours is the only one allowed to kill humans.

00:03:55.490 --> 00:03:56.850
We're counting on you.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.560
Did we really have to do this?

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.120
What are you talking about?

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:13.360
At this rate Bishop Mibu is going to...

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:19.460
If Bishop Tagami really has secret connections with Akasha, Bishop Mibu is going to kill him.

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:25.100
It's all for the Kougon cult’s sake.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:42.860
I can't believe that Oori is connected with the betrayer priest.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.210
But we’re still going to kill him, right?

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.280
Let’s go.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:53.180
I can't believe you're a Shikabane Hime, Yamagami-san.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.780
So there is not just one Shikabane Hime?

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:00.410
I believe there are more than you think.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.190
And what about that teacher?

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:07.380
You could consider him like something extra that comes with us.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.030
Your protector, you mean!

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.280
He is a Contracted Priest, just like your brother.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:15.620
You know my brother?

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:17.270
Of course.

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:19.520
That day I was...

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:23.490
Don't interfere!

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:24.500
I am...

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.310
That's hard, you know!

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:30.310
Who is the one interfering here?

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:37.110
He is the one gathering young people with that rental car and making them kill each other.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.190
Do you know why?

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:41.850
So he could create Corpses.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.480
We will defeat him.

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:47.140
Get out of the way, you're useless.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.140
Run, Oori-kun.

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:50.060
Go!

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:01.400
What a shame.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:04.490
It was just about to get amusing.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.900
Not only did we find out he has nothing to do with you...

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.880
...now we know that all of the rest is the Kougon cult's problem.

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:12.380
I heard about this before.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:13.890
A betrayer priest.

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:19.730
He infiltrated the head temple, stole the holy scripture, and murdered his own Shikabane Hime.

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.290
That is right.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.010
Why don't I introduce myself?

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:29.680
I'm Shishido Akasha, the Kougon cult's former first ranked priest.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.040
Answer me!

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:33.670
Why did you murder your own Shikabane Hime?

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:37.280
And why are you trying to create Corpses?

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:38.810
Who knows?

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:41.560
Why don't you try to think for yourself for a change?

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:45.380
Doesn't a Corpse's brain work correctly?

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:53.680
It's true that I am the betrayer priest you're looking for, but I am not a Corpse.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:57.960
Can you who is a Shikabane Hime, kill a human being?

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:01.600
I don't think the Kougon cult will allow you to do that.

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:06.260
But if done correctly, we are allowed to hurt you.

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:10.220
You touched me.

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.300
Did it hurt?

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.410
You touched me with your dirty Shikabane Hime hands.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.150
What's that?

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.590
It's a shame I have to use this on you.

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:30.080
This will compensate your crime of touching me.

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:34.970
Open.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.680
My Zadan technique!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.580
Zadan technique?!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.550
On-jiri-jei-sowaka.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:43.880
Itsuki!

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:44.430
Get away from him!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:48.760
I can't move!

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:51.250
Note: Kisou Renge literally means Fantastic Idea Lotus.
Kisou Renge.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.870
Get out of the way, you're useless.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.040
Again...

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.400
I've been told again.

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:10.940
So please don't come again.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:32.630
What am I good for?

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.600
I can't see where the Corpse's brains are.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:15.980
If you don't want to die, just go away.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:17.860
Ouch.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:19.970
That girl told me the same thing.

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:21.730
Itsuki?

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:23.120
You know her?

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:25.230
Because you're both Shikabane Himes?

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.990
I only met her once.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:28.290
What about you?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:29.310
Why were you with that girl?

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.130
Say.

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:35.470
What did you mean by my existence is stopping my brother's work?

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:38.100
This is not the time to talk about that.

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:39.660
You know that...

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:40.730
Answer me!

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:46.450
People grow stronger when there are ones to protect around them.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:52.470
But there are also cases where people get killed because they stand in their way.

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:55.790
Are you saying that my brother will die, because I am around him?

00:09:56.810 --> 00:10:01.200
The more you get involved, the worse Keisei gets hurt mentally.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:06.120
That's why I don't want you to come near.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:08.520
It's not for my bro's sake.

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:10.050
It's for your own sake, right?

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.000
You want to go to heaven, right?

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.310
You want to kill a hundred and eight Corpses.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:18.810
That's true.

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:20.840
That is the contract.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.480
What's heaven good for?

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:24.130
It's all just for yourself.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.140
If you want to die, die alone!

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:28.930
Don't involve my bro!

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:32.780
I...

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:34.170
Makina!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:37.550
It's gone!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:07.910
Keisei?

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.440
Do it.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:41.980
Bro!

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:42.990
What are you doing?

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.100
I made a promise.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.100
What kind of promise?

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:56.840
You're getting wounded badly to help her, and now she's missing an arm.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:01.700
What kind of promise would be good enough to endure such a thing?

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:05.230
I don't think that she believes in heaven.

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:15.000
As soon as she came back alive as a Corpse, she had two choices.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:19.630
She could have become a Corpse and attack this holy world...

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:25.030
...or she could be revived as a human being by becoming a Corpse killing Shikabane Hime.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.950
Aren't both of those choices terrible?!

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:28.820
Yes.

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:30.930
But this is the choice she made.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:35.240
And I promised her, I would be by her side.

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:13.290
Keisei.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:23.700
Found it.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:43.280
Is everybody in the car all right?

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:46.290
There was one more girl, but she...

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:52.330
He really said he was the betrayer priest?

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:52.970
Yes.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.200
And he knew about you and me.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.900
It must be Akasha.

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:58.670
Who is that, Keisei?

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:01.820
Stop it!

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.140
Don’t worry, this is a shouma.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.040
Note: Shouma is an amplifying drink that makes priests as strong as Corpses for a short period of time.

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:07.920
It's a painkiller from the Kougon cult.

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:09.480
If he really...

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:10.170
But...

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:12.570
The side effects are bad, right?

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:13.620
I'll be alright.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.000
Say...

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.200
Hoshimura-san, bro...

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:20.090
I understand how important your promise is.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:20.990
I'm sorry.

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:22.990
Bro.

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:25.590
Why won't you make a promise with me too?

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:27.760
Promise me you won't die.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.530
I'm not looking for death but neither do I fear it.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:36.080
Death is walking aside us.

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:41.090
I'm sorry, but I can't promise that.

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:01.240
Itsuki...

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:06.300
Genpaku?

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:09.250
When did you become in charge of this area?

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:12.890
I'm sorry, Tagami Shikei.

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:14.720
I see.

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:16.360
You were investigating Oori and I.

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:19.080
Akasha.

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.570
It's been a while.

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:22.730
Shikei.

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:24.730
Makina!

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:26.770
You can't do anything with your wound.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.770
That’s a Zadan technique.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.310
A Zadan technique?

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:37.560
It's one of the symbolic techniques of the Kougon cult.

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:48.000
It makes it possible for you to create a miracle by using ritual articles to open sutras and to collect the powers of stars and gods.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:51.010
Do you call that a miracle?

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:56.990
Five years ago, Sadahiro and I were the only ones able to open this.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:03.300
It must be the first time for you and the young Genpaku to see such a thing.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:06.220
Those are Corpses.

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:07.520
Yes.

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:13.330
It holds those who have become Corpses after killing each other in that rental car.

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:15.150
In my Zadan, I mean.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:19.030
You are using the Corpses's attachment to this world as a weapon.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.270
I'm only using the Corpses, just like what the Kougon cult is doing.

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:36.380
Only I'm not letting the Corpses keep their hearts.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.200
I only use their force.

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:42.650
That brings much less suffering to them.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.040
You're wrong.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:47.190
You've killed them twice.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:50.830
You made them kill each other so that you could create Corpses.

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:53.840
And you used those Corpses as the ingredient for your Zadan.

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:57.080
You're as kind as usual, Shikei.

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.930
You're putting your emotions into that doll.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:03.670
Maybe you'll even be able to love it.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:06.480
Makina!

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:10.850
I'm sure he has a highly powered ritual tool to open that strong Zadan.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:14.630
I'm not sure if it was a ritual tool, but he showed a dusky red box.

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:17.290
How long are you planning to sleep, ribbon princess?

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:22.640
Ah, Makina-chan.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.350
Did you make up with Kagami-kun?

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.140
What are you talking about?

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:28.400
Let's get rid of this Zadan spell!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:31.430
Stop ordering me around.

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:33.430
Guns are useless.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:38.030
Guns aren't only used for shooting.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:56.680
That's it.

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:58.640
Bro!

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:00.550
Shikei!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:13.770
Keisei!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.770
Without medium...

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.980
It's not a bad idea to try to damage the medium.

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:26.780
But that box is not an ordinary ritual tool.

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:30.570
It's made out of the bloods I collected from 108 people when they died.

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:32.710
Bro!

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:37.970
A person's attachment can become a Corpse and become powerful.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.490
And 108 of them...

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.060
That's unbelievable.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:47.370
A normal human being would lose consciousness by only touching that box.

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:52.830
I think you knew this would happen, if you get attached to your Shikabane Hime.

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:59.370
It was you who loved your Shikabane Hime the most, wasn't it?

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.290
Is that the reason...

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.440
...why you betrayed the Kougon cult?

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:09.490
Was it because you couldn't look in your Shikabane Hime's eyes anymore?

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:12.670
No, Shikei.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:16.980
I didn't betray the Kougon cult.

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:20.450
The Kougon cult betrayed me.

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:32.480
He shouldn't be able to move!

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:38.810
Souma?

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.030
Impossible!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:43.090
By doing this, the blood will start to overflow from the box and...

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:47.020
...one hundred and eight Corpses's attachments to this world will cover us.

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:51.360
You can die if you get spiritually damaged.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:54.660
This was the only thing I could think of.

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:55.900
I'm sorry.

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:06.280
You have to be more resistant to this than me, Shikei!

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:17.330
What is this?

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:19.150
This wasn't a normal bullet.

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:20.510
It was created through a Zadan technique!

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:22.680
It couldn't be?!

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:24.820
Get further away from me.

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:26.440
I can't.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:30.600
I need to put my Zadan technique in your bullet.

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:32.250
It's Sadahiro.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:36.650
Let's meet again, Shikei.

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:42.860
See you the day my Corpses destroy the Kougon cult.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:57.440
Is that enough?

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:03.970
He took the enemy's attack and used Akasha's medium as a shield.

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:07.500
Anyway, Keisei is not a betrayer.

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:09.610
Are you relieved?

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:11.870
Well then...

00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:16.030
There isn't any problem with Tagami Keisei continuing his job?

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:17.040
No.

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:23.840
Akasha...

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:28.410
Are you all right, bro?

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:34.740
I'll make you the promise in Keisei's place.

00:21:37.110 --> 00:21:38.610
I won't let Keisei die.

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:41.250
I'll protect Keisei.

00:23:27.690 --> 00:23:31.040
People understand each other, because they use words.

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:32.750
Don't make me laugh.

00:23:33.170 --> 00:23:38.550
But people get deceived by words and get conquered by the false soul of language.
